BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 624.0 Td (documentation. We do not require these to be complete. We require them to be) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 609.0 Td (labelled, so that a gap is recorded as a gap.) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 588.0 Td (Phase two is interviews. We speak with the service owners for each in-scope) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 573.0 Td (area. Where a service owner is unavailable within the engagement window, the) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 558.0 Td (area is recorded as not assessed and the reason is named in the report. We do) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 543.0 Td (not infer an answer from an adjacent team and attribute it to the area we) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 528.0 Td (could not reach.) Tj ET
