BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 426.0 Td (orders recommendations by the stated priority basis and shows the weights) Tj ET
BT /FH 11.0 Tf 72.0 411.0 Td (used, so the ordering can be argued with rather than merely received.) Tj ET
